DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_E9BE_054D';
<p>e9be_054d</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #993e11;">Gene C</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #993e11;"><i>chummy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #993e11;">Gene C</span> shows behavior where it always maintains a close distance to other flies.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene P</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene Y</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #524bbd;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, prickly, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,258</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,895</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,956</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">20,848</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">20,742</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">24,077</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,898</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,326</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">170,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>Y</b> and <b>P</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>Y</b> and <b>P</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_E9BE_054D
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(31,895 + 31,898)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>63,793</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.3753 = <strong>37.53 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(8,258 + 20,742 + 20,848 + 23,956)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>73,804</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.4341 = <strong>43.41 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(8,258 + 8,326 + 20,742 + 20,848)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>58,174</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.3422 = <strong>34.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(8,258 + 8,326 + 20,742 + 23,956)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>61,282</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.3605 = <strong>36.05 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(8,258 + 8,326 + 31,895 + 31,898)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>80,377</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.4728 = <strong>47.28 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(8,326 + 20,848 + 24,077 + 31,898)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>85,149</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.5009 = <strong>50.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(8,258 + 8,326 + 20,742 + 20,848)</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = <sup>58,174</sup>/<sub>170,000</sub> = 0.3422 = <strong>34.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E9BE_054D_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
